{"tool_name":"vmtk:-vascular-modeling-toolkit","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>vmtk is a collection of libraries and tools for 3D reconstruction, geometric analysis, mesh generation and surface data analysis for image-based modeling of blood vessels.</p>\n\n<p>vmtk is composed of</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>C++ classes (<a href=\"http://www.vtk.org\">VTK</a> and <a href=\"http://www.itk.org\">ITK</a> -based algorithms)</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.python.org\">Python</a> classes (high-level functionality - each class is a script)</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.vmtk.org/documentation/pypes.html\">PypeS</a> - Python pipeable scripts, a framework which enables vmtk scripts to interact with each other</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>vmtk is a collection of libraries and tools for 3D reconstruction, geometric analysis, mesh generation and surface data analysis for image-based modeling of blood vessels.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>vmtk is composed of</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>C++ classes (<a href=\"http://www.vtk.org\">VTK</a> and <a href=\"http://www.itk.org\">ITK</a> -based algorithms)</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.python.org\">Python</a> classes (high-level functionality - each class is a script)</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.vmtk.org/documentation/pypes.html\">PypeS</a> - Python pipeable scripts, a framework which enables vmtk scripts to interact with each other</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-08-07T12:05:11+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-28T18:22:05+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4365,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"169ccd6f-f3bd-4e21-9f05-26fd62e87f6b","url":"/taxonomy/term/4365"},{"target_id":4366,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"720f4bc0-2d13-437c-924c-51678c7d0d8e","url":"